            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa visualizza questo codice nella console?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" counter = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (counter &lt; \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(counter);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" counter++;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"0\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /></content></output></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">I numeri da <code>0</code> a <code>2</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">I numeri da <code>1</code> a <code>3</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">I numeri da <code>0</code> a <code>3</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">I numeri da <code>0</code> a <code>2</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Sposti <code>counter++;</code> prima di <code>console.log(counter);</code>. Quali numeri visualizzerà il ciclo?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" counter = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (counter &lt; \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(counter);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" counter++;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"0\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /></content></output></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">I numeri da 1 a 3.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">I numeri da 0 a 2.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">I numeri da 0 a 3.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">I numeri da 1 a 3.</p></body></html>",
