            "id": 74825,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual è il nome della variabile contatore in questo codice?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Fastest runners:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" index = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; index &lt; \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; index++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(index + \" /><text value=\"&quot;.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Fastest runners:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"1.\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2.\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3.\" /></content></output></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>index</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>i</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>Fastest runners:</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>index</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual è il nome della variabile contatore in questo codice?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Fastest runners:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" index = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; index &lt; \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; index++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(index + \" /><text value=\"&quot;.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Fastest runners:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"1.\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2.\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3.\" /></content></output></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>index</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>i</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>Fastest runners:</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>counter</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>index</code>.</p></body></html>"
