            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>All'interno delle parentesi, incrementa la variabile contatore usando l'operatore <code>++</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;*&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" line = \" /><text value=\"&quot;&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt;= \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" line += \" /><text value=\"&quot;~&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(line);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"57\" endIndex=\"60\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"*\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"~\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"~~\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"~~~\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"~~~~\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"~~~~~\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>i++</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: i counter",
            "id": 74826,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quale variabile è la variabile contatore del ciclo for?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" title = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Numbers:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" line = \" /><text value=\"&quot;&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt; \" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" line += i;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(line);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"12345\" /></content></output></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>i</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>title</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>line</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>i</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Vuoi che il contatore aumenti di due ogni volta. Quale parte tra parentesi devi sostituire?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" title = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Numbers:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" line = \" /><text value=\"&quot;&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt; \" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" line += i;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(line);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"12345\" /></content></output></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>i++</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>let i = 1</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>i &lt; 6</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>i++</code>.</p></body></html>",
